{"id":"64f5512c46390bf2","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-automorphism.md","title":"偏序结构的自动同构","display":"df-automorphism — 偏序结构的自动同构","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-automorphism","aliases":["20-df-automorphism"],"display":"df-automorphism — 偏序结构的自动同构","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.ce-lattice","source_kind":"local-supplement","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"本地结构定义","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-automorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-automorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-automorphism — 偏序结构的自动同构"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.ce-lattice"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"本地结构定义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak P=(P,\\le_P)\">\\(\\mathfrak P=(P,\\le_P)\\)</span> 为偏序结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:P\\to P\">\\(\\Phi:P\\to P\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}automorphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathfrak P):=\\{\\Phi:P\\to P:\n(\\forall x,y\\in P\\ [\\Phi(x)=\\Phi(y)\\Rightarrow x=y])\\land(\\forall y\\in P\\ \\exists x\\in P\\ \\Phi(x)=y)\\land\\forall a,b\\in P\\\n(a\\le_Pb\\Longleftrightarrow\\Phi(a)\\le_P\\Phi(b))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}automorphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathfrak P):=\\{\\Phi:P\\to P:\n(\\forall x,y\\in P\\ [\\Phi(x)=\\Phi(y)\\Rightarrow x=y])\\land(\\forall y\\in P\\ \\exists x\\in P\\ \\Phi(x)=y)\\land\\forall a,b\\in P\\\n(a\\le_Pb\\Longleftrightarrow\\Phi(a)\\le_P\\Phi(b))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>双射可展开为单射及满射两个条件。自动同构作用于结构的元素，不自动给出对程序索引的可计算映射。对 c.e. 集合格，原子单元素集合的像确定一个底层自然数置换。</p>\n<p>来源：本地结构定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak P=(P,\\le_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi:P\\to P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}automorphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathfrak P):=\\{\\Phi:P\\to P:\n(\\forall x,y\\in P\\ [\\Phi(x)=\\Phi(y)\\Rightarrow x=y])\\land(\\forall y\\in P\\ \\exists x\\in P\\ \\Phi(x)=y)\\land\\forall a,b\\in P\\\n(a\\le_Pb\\Longleftrightarrow\\Phi(a)\\le_P\\Phi(b))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1084,"backlinks":[{"id":"545885bb8d24620a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-maximal]]；see [[20-df-automorphism]]；see [[20-df-lattice-re]]。"},{"id":"096387ba1b2d18f5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-automorphism]]；see [[20-df-lattice-re]]；see [[20-lem-cohesive-exists]]；see [[20-df-arith]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-automorphism]] — 章 supplement；直接提供者 0 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-automorphism]]"}],"outgoing":[]}